Package: networkGen
Type: Package
Title: Build PCSF Networks from Kinase-Activity Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dora", "Schuller", email = "dschuller@pamgene.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Builds prize-collecting Steiner forest (PCSF) networks from
    kinase-activity (UKA) data, optionally paired with sensitivity data.
    Foundation package of the network suite (see networkScore, networkPlot)
    -- no scoring, enrichment, or plotting logic lives here.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
